  "releaseNotes": "Adds minimal command support with fluent configuration\n\n      Introduces a simplified command registration system allowing for quick command setup with  lambda expressions. This enhances developer experience by:\n\n        - Adding a MinimalCommand class for lightweight command definitions\n        - Implementing a fluent API for command configuration\n        - Supporting both registry-based and minimal commands simultaneously\n        - Making the ConsoleApplication instance accessible via static Current property\n\n      Commands can now be added directly using AddCommand() with an action delegate, reducing  boilerplate compared to implementing full ICommand interfaces.",
